            "description": "Ouro MD is a local Markdown workspace for people who keep real files, not a hosted notes account.\n\nOpen Markdown documents and folders directly from Finder, then move through your workspace with a native file tree, document outline, folder search, and a command palette built for fast keyboard-driven editing. Ouro MD keeps writing local and portable while still giving you polished rendered reading, themes, wide-table handling, and export to PDF or self-contained HTML.\n\nNo sign-in is required. Your Markdown files stay on your Mac unless you choose to share or export them.",
